# 7. FEEDBACK QUESTIONS

Create the following 15 evaluation criteria.

### Q1

Faculty comes to class regularly and punctually.

### Q2

Faculty demonstrates thorough subject knowledge and command over the course.

### Q3

Concepts are explained clearly and systematically.

### Q4

Course outcomes and objectives are explained clearly.

### Q5

Teaching methodology is effective.

### Q6

Faculty effectively uses ICT tools such as PPT, videos, smart boards, simulations and LMS.

### Q7

Faculty encourages student participation and interaction.

### Q8

Faculty explains concepts using real-life and industry examples.

### Q9

Faculty completes the syllabus according to the academic schedule.

### Q10

Faculty conducts quizzes, assignments and tutorials regularly.

### Q11

Faculty provides timely and constructive feedback on assignments and tests.

### Q12

Internal assessment is fair and transparent.

### Q13

Faculty is available for academic guidance outside regular class hours.

### Q14

Faculty motivates students toward higher-order thinking and problem solving.

### Q15

Overall effectiveness of teaching.

Every question is mandatory.

Do not allow form submission until all 15 questions have been answered.

