# 11. GRADING SYSTEM

Implement:

| Total    | Grade | Performance       |
| -------- | ----- | ----------------- |
| 68–75    | A+    | Outstanding       |
| 60–67    | A     | Excellent         |
| 52–59    | B+    | Very Good         |
| 45–51    | B     | Good              |
| 37–44    | C     | Satisfactory      |
| Below 37 | D     | Needs Improvement |

Also provide percentage-based IQAC interpretation:

* 90–100% → Excellent Performance
* 80–89.99% → Very Good
* 70–79.99% → Good
* 60–69.99% → Satisfactory
* Below 60% → Improvement Required

Keep **Grade/Performance** and **IQAC Interpretation** as separate fields so the two reporting systems are not confused.

